You augment your shield with your heavy weapon technology, causing an effect when you Block with a heavy weapon equipped.

Flamethrower: Vent choking, burning smoke in an area of the same radius as your flamethrower. Enemies caught within take [194%, 213%, 227%, 239%, 250% (TL1-5)] shield damage as fire and are silenced for [3, 3, 4, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.

Shockstaff: Sheathe your shield in lightning and attack all enemies in radius 3, dealing [311%, 358%, 393%, 423%, 450% (TL1-5)] shield damage as lightning and gaining a barrier absorbing an amount of damage equal to 100% of the highest damage dealt for 6 turns.

Boltgun: Fire a blast of flechettes from your shield at all enemies in radius 7, dealing [66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100% (TL1-5)] shield damage as acid. [4, 6, 8, 10, 12 (TL1-5)] flechettes remain embedded in each target for 6 turns, and when struck by a melee or ranged attack a flechette will detonate and cause acid damage equal to 50% of the shield damage dealt.

These attacks will not trigger Counterstrike.

The chance to silence will increase with your Steampower.
